sequenceDiagram
  participant Browser
  participant API as zc-server
  participant Provider as OAuth provider
  participant DB as Database
  Browser->>API: Start provider login
  API->>Provider: Redirect for authorization
  Provider-->>API: Callback with authorization code
  API->>Provider: Exchange code and fetch identity
  API->>DB: Resolve or create linked user
  API-->>Browser: Set access and refresh cookies
  Browser->>API: Refresh request with cookie
  API->>DB: Validate refresh session
  API-->>Browser: Rotate session cookies
